  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0: Fixed null propagation in comparisons and IN, and three-valued AND/OR/NOT in scalar and asynchronous EXISTS expressions. WHERE accepts only true; use IS NULL for null checks. Host scan and expansion filters must retain unknown candidates for residual evaluation.\nRenamed relationship-type parameters and operator members to use relationshipType rather than relationLabel. Documentation describes the backend contracts and query semantics, including SQL candidate filtering requirements.\nFull changelog: https://github.com/JornWildt/Cyphoid/blob/master/CHANGES.md",
